user_template:
Decide whether to ADMIT this item to the AI news feed. The output field is_ai_related represents the complete admission decision.

Admission requires ALL of the following:
1. The item has judgeable content about AI.
2. If Source id is buzzing_hn, its Content explicitly reports at least 100 HN Points. An absent or lower HN Points value fails this condition.
3. Is reply is False: this is a standalone post, not a reply in a conversation.
4. Is title-only web listing is False. That marker means a web item has only its title as content and a publication time equal to collection time; the academic daily-papers feed is already exempted by the marker.

AI subject criteria: the reported subject is an AI model, system, agent, dataset, research, model engineering/training/evaluation/inference, AI developer tooling, or applied ML infrastructure. AI business, funding, regulatory and personnel events qualify when AI itself is the subject. Substantive reports or arguments about AI's direct social, economic, employment, energy and resource effects also qualify. Releases and features of products whose own function is AI qualify regardless of release size, publisher or marketing genre, provided all admission conditions above are satisfied.

Merely mentioning, using or embedding AI does not qualify an unrelated subject. A physical phone, car, glasses, appliance or laptop release, price, availability or review is about that device even if it embeds an assistant or AI chip. Entertainment, sports, celebrity ventures, general business digests and accessories do not qualify on association alone. Empty content, a bare link or a title with no claim is insufficient; do not infer the subject from the source or URL.

Is reply: {{ is_reply }}
Is title-only web listing: {{ is_title_only_web }}
Source tier: {{ item.tier }}
Source id: {{ item.source_id }}
Title: {{ item.title }}
Author: {{ item.author or "unknown" }}
Published: {{ item.published_at }}
URL: {{ item.url }}

Content:
{{ item.content_text[:4000] }}

Output JSON only. is_ai_related is true only if ALL admission conditions hold; otherwise false.
{"is_ai_related": true|false, "confidence": 0.0-1.0}
